                "description": "Fusion BU-G9, Nevada Lever with Rectangular Rose - Part of Fusion's Rock Ridge Collection, the Nevada Lever with Rectangular Rose is featured with an oil rubbed bronze finish. It is available in dummy, passage and privacy functions. This Nevada Leverset is made to fit doors with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches and will adjust to fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches thick.",
